 * object when `options.header` lists the column names; the header row is then
 * written first. Every record, the last included, ends with `options.eol`.
 *
 * @param {Array<unknown[] | Record<string, unknown>>} rows
 * @param {{delimiter?: string, eol?: '\r\n' | '\n', header?: string[]}} [options]
 * @returns {string}
 * @throws {TypeError} for invalid rows, values or options.
